                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does skincare photography cost per SKU?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 1,200-4,000 per SKU top-tier (Mumbai + Delhi + Bengaluru) for 12-shot + video + edit. Rs 700-1,500 basic. Rs 500-1,200 tier-2 (quality varies). AED 180-500 in Dubai. Rs 200-500 marginal in-house.</p>
                                        <h3>Should we hire freelance, agency, or build in-house studio?</h3>
                                        <p>Freelance for boutique + 10-40 SKUs/month + variable cadence. Specialist agency for Growth-tier + 30-100 SKUs/month. In-house studio for Rs 20 Cr+/month + 100+ SKUs/month sustained. Agency-embedded pod (bundled into marketing retainer) best for most Growth-tier.</p>
                                        <h3>What equipment does a skincare photography studio need?</h3>
                                        <p>60MP+ camera + 90/100mm macro lens + continuous LED lighting + ring + spot for texture + white + neutral + textured backgrounds + X-Rite ColorChecker + calibrated monitor + editing workstation. Rs 8-18L in-house setup.</p>
                                        <h3>How many SKUs per week can serious skincare photography ship?</h3>
                                        <p>25-100 SKUs / week for Growth-tier with proper batch workflow (Day 1 pre-production + Day 2-3 shoot + Day 4-5 editing + Day 6 QA + Day 7 buffer). Below 25/week unit economics don't justify dedicated setup.</p>
                                        <h3>Can we use AI-generated skincare photography?</h3>
                                        <p>AI-augmented workflow (canonical 3-5 shots + AI background swap via Photoroom / Cloudinary) cuts cost 30-50% + speeds output 3-5x. Full AI-generated unreliable for high-value + trust-critical shots. AI-augmented current sweet spot.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the difference between skincare specialist and generic e-com photographer?</h3>
                                        <p>Specialist: texture + swatch preservation + macro + ingredient photography + before-after compliance-safe + skincare-trained retoucher + tutorial video + on-model multiple skin tones. Specialist charges 30-70% premium + delivers 2-3x conversion lift.</p>
                                        <h3>How does compliance-safe before-after work in photography?</h3>
                                        <p>Same person + same lighting + same angle + same time-frame + substantiated by clinical/consumer study + disclaimer language. See <a href="/resources/skincare_before_after_content_asci_esma.php">before-after compliance playbook</a>.</p>
                                        <h3>How does ITD handle skincare photography for clients?</h3>
                                        <p>In-house pod dedicated to skincare + adjacent D2C. Photographer + retoucher + video editor trained on skincare requirements. Batch workflow 100-300 SKUs / month. Bundled with marketing retainer. See <a href="/resources/skincare_product_photography_d2c.php">skincare photography playbook</a>.</p>
